<title>GERMANY: KME H1 1996 profit risee.</title>
<headline>KME H1 1996 profit risee.</headline>
<dateline>OSNABRUECK, Germany 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     54.1    vs 51.2</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,014   vs 1,863</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    2,023   vs 1,872</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is KM Europa Metal AG. The company said its positive earnings development would continue in the second half, allowing the payment of a satisfactory dividend. -- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
